  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve04",
      "hash64": "530F6C48C19F48DD",
      "text": "¿Conoces a Mencía, la delegada?\\c\\nDicen que se sabe de memoria los movimientos\\nde todos los Pokémon, ¡y lo que hace cada uno!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve05",
      "hash64": "530F6B48C19F472A",
      "text": "A mi Pachirisu le encantan los sitios altos.\\n¡Ji, ji!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve07",
      "hash64": "530F6948C19F43C4",
      "text": "El Haunter de mi amigo evolucionó a Gengar\\ncuando me lo envió. ¡Menudo susto me llevé!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve08",
      "hash64": "530F6048C19F3479",
      "text": "¡Qué grandotes son los Pokémon evolucionados!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve09",
      "hash64": "530F5F48C19F32C6",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni01",
      "hash64": "6D85DE7704923977",
      "text": "En mi cuarto tengo mil formas de distraerme...\\nEstudiando aquí, el tiempo me cunde mucho más.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni02",
      "hash64": "6D85DF7704923B2A",
      "text": "¿Soy yo o todo se llena de Pokémon de tipo\\nFantasma por la noche?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni03",
      "hash64": "6D85E07704923CDD",
      "text": "Es curioso que dos Pokémon de la misma especie\\npuedan tener teratipos totalmente distintos, ¿no?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni04",
      "hash64": "6D85D977049230F8",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni05",
      "hash64": "6D85DA77049232AB",
      "text": "Alguien me ha enviado a este pequeñín a través\\nde un intercambio mágico.\\c\\nMuchísimas gracias, amable desconocido,\\n¡estés donde estés!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
